{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_215_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_215","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_215_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_215","textTraditional":"二年春王正月。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_215_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_215","textTraditional":"夏五月壬辰，雉門及兩觀災。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_215_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_215","textTraditional":"秋，楚人伐吳。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_215_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_215","textTraditional":"冬十月，新作雉門及兩觀。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_215_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_215","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_215_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_215","textTraditional":"二年夏四月辛酉，鞏氏之群子弟賊簡公。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_215_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_215","textTraditional":"桐叛楚。吳子使舒鳩氏誘楚人，曰：「以師臨我，我伐桐，為我使之無忌。」秋，楚囊瓦伐吳，師于豫章。吳人見舟于豫章，而潛師于巢。冬十月，吳軍楚師于豫章，敗之。遂圍巢，克之，獲楚公子繁。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_215_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_215","textTraditional":"邾莊公與夷射姑飲酒，私出。閽乞肉焉，奪之杖以敲之。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}